                    <monstor_v5:Company_aboutCompany>Paytm is an Indian multinational financial technology company based in Noida, India, specializing in digital payments and financial services. Founded in 2010 by Vijay Shekhar Sharma under One97 Communications, Paytm provides mobile payment services for consumers and enables merchants to accept payments through various methods like QR codes, Soundbox, and online payment gateways. The company also offers financial services in partnership with financial institutions, such as microcredit and buy now, pay later options.</monstor_v5:Company_aboutCompany>
