            <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/ak960/ontologies/2025/4/monstor_v5#Job_109809283"/>
            <naukri-version-1:Jobs_Key_Skills>Talent Acquisition, Management, Stakeholder Management, Recruitment Lead, Recruitment</naukri-version-1:Jobs_Key_Skills>
            <naukri-version-1:Jobs_Industry>Banking</naukri-version-1:Jobs_Industry>
            <naukri-version-1:Jobs_Location>Noida</naukri-version-1:Jobs_Location>
            <naukri-version-1:Jobs_Job_Description>We are seeking an experienced Talent Acquisition Manager to lead recruitment in Noida You will develop and implement effective strategies, manage the full recruitment lifecycle, and lead a team of field recruiters and vendor associates to meet our hiring needs, particularly for sales sub-departments
Key Responsibilities:
Develop and implement recruitment strategies
Manage end-to-end recruitment (sourcing, screening, interviewing, onboarding)
Collaborate with Regional Heads on hiring requirements
Manage vendor relationships and payouts
Lead and manage a team of Field Recruiters and Vendor Associates
Utilize data to improve recruitment metrics and processes
Qualifications:
Bachelors degree
5+ years of Talent Acquisition experience
Experience managing a recruitment team preferred
Strong understanding of sourcing and recruitment processes
Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills
Experience with vendor management and ATS
Data-driven approach to recruitment</naukri-version-1:Jobs_Job_Description>
            <naukri-version-1:Jobs_Max_Experience_Years rdf:datatype=
            "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">8</naukri-version-1:Jobs_Max_Experience_Years>
            <naukri-version-1:Jobs_Min_Education_PG>Any Postgraduate</naukri-version-1:Jobs_Min_Education_PG>
            <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"/>
            <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/ak960/ontologies/2025/4/monstor_v5#Job_Posting"/>
            <monstor_v5:Job_function>Human Resources</monstor_v5:Job_function>
            <monstor_v5:Job_experienceMin rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"
            >5</monstor_v5:Job_experienceMin>
            <monstor_v5:Job_jobTitle>Talent Acquisition Manager-Paytm Money</monstor_v5:Job_jobTitle>
            <monstor_v5:Job_jobDescription>Job Description
Location: Noida or Remote

About Paytm Money:

Paytm Money is a leading digital financial services platform that offers a range of investment products and services to empower individuals to grow their wealth. As a Talent Acquisition Intern at Paytm Money, you will play a crucial role in helping us build a talented team that drives innovation in the fintech industry.

Position Overview:

As a Talent Acquisition Intern, you will work closely with our HR team to support the end-to-end recruitment process. This internship offers hands-on experience in sourcing, screening, and onboarding candidates for various roles within Paytm Money.

Key Responsibilities:

Assist in sourcing candidates through job portals, social media platforms, and professional networks.
Screen resumes and conduct initial assessments to identify potential candidates.
Schedule and coordinate interviews with candidates and hiring managers.
Support in drafting job descriptions and job advertisements.
Maintain and update candidate databases and our applicant tracking system (ATS).
Assist in conducting reference checks and background verifications.
Participate in employer branding initiatives to attract top talent.
Requirements:

Currently pursuing a degree in Human Resources, Business Administration, or a related field (if applicable).
Strong communication skills and ability to interact professionally with candidates and team members.
Detail-oriented with excellent organizational skills.
Ability to prioritize tasks and work efficiently in a fast-paced environment.
Proficiency in MS Office (Word, Excel, Outlook) and familiarity with ATS is a plus.
Proactive attitude and eagerness to learn about talent acquisition processes.
Benefits:

Gain valuable hands-on experience in talent acquisition and recruitment within a leading fintech organization.
Opportunity to work closely with experienced HR professionals and receive mentorship.
Flexible work environment: option to work remotely or from our Noida office.
Certification upon successful completion of the internship.
Contribute to shaping the future of fintech through innovative recruitment strategies.
Duration: 3 Months</monstor_v5:Job_jobDescription>
