    <monstor_v5:Company_aboutCompany>Google is a multinational technology company primarily known for its search engine and a wide array of internet services. Founded in 1998 by Larry Page and Sergey Brin, the company's mission is to "organize the world's information and make it universally accessible and useful". Google's headquarters, known as the "Googleplex," are located in Mountain View, California.</monstor_v5:Company_aboutCompany>
